Sure! Those coordinates ( **37.4224764, –122.0842499** ) point to the Googleplex in Mountain View, California.  
Below is what you would see if you hit the Google Geocoding API with those values:

---

### Example API Call

```http
GET https://maps.googleapis.com/maps/api/geocode/json?latlng=37.4224764,-122.0842499&key=YOUR_API_KEY
```

> **Note:** Replace `YOUR_API_KEY` with your actual Google Maps API key.  
> If you’re just testing, you can use the free “demo” key that Google provides for limited requests.

---

